<lb n="11"/>Wan <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dan</unclear> nun selbiges der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">billigkeit</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gemeeß</unclear>, und
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> recht also erforderen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuot</unclear>, willen aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">marg</unclear>-
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ens</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">füijrtag</unclear> zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deme</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">järliche</unclear> crütz-
